# Allowlist: ignore everything in this folder, then let through only the files below.
# Never commit .credentials.json, history.jsonl, projects/ (chat transcripts, memory) or caches.
/*
!/.gitignore
!/CLAUDE.md
!/README.md
!/settings.json
!/skills/
!/guides/
!/hooks/
/hooks/*.log
/hooks/notify.off
# Managed by the Claude app, not by hand
/skills/synced/
/skills/.trash/
